+    if Input.trigger?(Input::F5) && !Input.press?(Input::SHIFT) && !Input.press?(Input::CTRL) && !Input.press?(Input::ALT)

Reason:
- plain F5 belongs to the A1 Interactive Matrix Probe;
- SHIFT+F5 belongs exclusively to the Map091 Full Acceptance Harness;
- CTRL/ALT modifiers are excluded to avoid future diagnostic shortcut collisions.

The v1.06.60 packaged `Scripts.rvdata` contains the patched form above.
Formal v1.06.58 source is unaffected.
